stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: Create ticket with all steps unchecked
    Open --> InProgress: Complete at least one step
    InProgress --> Completed: Complete every step
    Open --> Completed: Complete the only step
    Completed --> InProgress: Reopen one of several completed steps
    Completed --> Open: Uncheck the only completed step
    InProgress --> Open: Uncheck all steps
    Open --> [*]: Authorized deletion
    InProgress --> [*]: Authorized deletion
    Completed --> [*]: Authorized deletion
    note right of InProgress
      Status is calculated from checklist booleans.
      There is no persisted status column.
      Assignment and ownership are separate.
    end note
